  *** THE MUTANTS SPAN THREE SOURCE FILES AND THE DRIVER MUST RESTORE AND CLEAR ALL THREE. ***  Derived by
  reading the first line of each preserved diff, not assumed:
      dev_lca.c     15  (RD2z WWtail WWall dNZtail W23 RWtail WW6 RD2post cdxZL3 Wpure RWall Wdrop WXR RXW Rdrop)
      dev_pckbc.c    1  (nox)
      dev_8253.c     1  (noff)
  BINARIES: /tmp/gxopus530c5_bins holds all 18 plus four `restored*' controls, and the clone /tmp/gxopus530c5 is
